> data\processed\docs\case-law\courts\sc\sc-appeal-27-2011-f6f00a14fb.md:3:1 IN THE SUPREME COURT OF THE DEMOCRATIC 
SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA In the matter of an Appeal from a Judgment of the Civil Appellate High Court. 
Ileperuma Arachchige Edwin Perera Gunathilaka, Galapatha, Bahurupola. Plaintiff K.M. Perera, 111C, Wewalduwa Road, 
Dalugama, Kelaniya. Substituted Plaintiff SC APPEAL 27/2011 SC HC CA LA 363/2010 Vs HC CA (Kalutara ) 25/2001(F) D.C. 
Kalutara Case No. 3089/P 1. Dona Yasawathie Weerakkodi of Karannagoda (Deceased) 1A. Nimal Lakshman Kannangara of 
Karannagoda. 2. Terlin Lenora Hamine of Doodangoda 3. Shanthilatha Waidyasekara of Karannagoda. 4. Dona Matilda 
